vilege, and the user is a member of the Administrators group.\r\r\n\r\r\nType 3 is a limited token with administrative privileges removed and administrative groups disabled.  The limited token is used when User Account Control is enabled, the application does not require administrative privilege, and the user does not choose to start the program using Run as administrator.\r\nevt-00529|4673|2026-05-06T00:01:49.959Z|WS-05.corp.example|m.ward|A privileged service was called.\r\r\n\r\r\nSubject:\r\r\n\tSecurity ID:\t\tS-1-5-21-4107722679-1012484280-3777968168-1104\r\r\n\tAccount Name:\t\tm.ward\r\r\n\tAccount Domain:\t\tCORP\r\r\n\tLogon ID:\t\t0x163D26\r\r\n\r\r\nService:\r\r\n\tServer:\tSecurity\r\r\n\tService Name:\t-\r\r\n\r\r\nProcess:\r\r\n\tProcess ID:\t0xd1c\r\r\n\tProcess Name:\tC:\\Users\\m.ward\\Desktop\\GruntHTTP.exe\r\r\n\r\r\nService Request Information:\r\r\n\tPrivileges:\t\tSeCreateGlobalPrivilege\r\nevt-00531|17|2026-05-06T00:01:49.960Z|WS-05.corp.example||Pipe Created:\r\r\nRuleName: -\r"]
